title: "casebound: reference implementation of case-bound control invariants for regulated agentic workflows"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the five case-bound control invariants, the five
  reference algorithms and the audit-reconstruction gate described in "Agent
  Security Meets Regulatory Reality". Runs on synthetic data only.
